                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A sharpening stone; a hard stone or piece of synthetically bonded hard minerals that has been formed with at least one flat surface, used to sharpen or hone an edged tool."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
