                                                "sense_id": "caba41fd-bc73-3fe5-87d6-ae96f94fe6da",
                                                "text": "It was as if a stone were ground to dust; as if white sparks flew from a livid whetstone, which was his spine; as if the switchback railway, having swooped to the depths, fell, fell, fell."
                                            }
